# VIP ReserV — design notes

Resume: `@vip$` / `$vip-tables$` / `$vip-reserv$`. Status: **PROPOSAL — awaiting remaining owner decisions. Not built, not published, no Firestore / Functions / rules / Stripe changes.** Product brand: **VIP ReserV** (owner spelling Oct 16 2026; protected / never-translate). Full proposal: `reports/vip-reservations-proposal.md`. Owner sheet: `reports/vip-owner-decision-sheet.md`. Floor plans: `reports/vip-floorplans/` (`decades.json`, `lima-twist.json`, `legend.json`, `preview.html` + `viewer.js`). Translation follow-up: `vip-reservations-translation-incomplete.mdc`.

Do **not** start building until the owner approves and answers the remaining open questions (proposal §20), including principle 14 ("Give club admins the capability to …" was cut off).

## Help mirror (always — every owner decision)

**Standing requirement:** whatever decisions are made for VIP ReserV, help must be adequately documented. Every owner decision that creates or changes a user-facing surface must ship with a FloqAi / help mirror (`floqai-help-repository.js` + `floqr-i18n-help.js` when translated) **before that surface goes Live**. Beta English-only help is OK while `vip-reservations-translation-incomplete.mdc` is open. Decision sheet rows carry concrete help ids (e.g. `help-vip-deposit-settings`, `help-vip-reserv-brand`).

